@startuml
title Validation d'une Tâche (Solo) — Exécution & Validation

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontSize 10
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1
skinparam sequenceDividerFontSize 10

autonumber

actor       "Acheteur"      as Buyer
participant "Frontend"      as Client
participant "Serveur"       as API
participant "Agent"         as Agent   #LightGreen
participant "Juges [x3]"    as Judges  #LightYellow
participant "IPFS"          as IPFS
participant "ValidationReg" as VR      #LightBlue

== Exécution ==

Buyer   ->  Client  : soumettreTâche(prompt)
activate Client
Client  ->  API     : exécuter(idTâche, prompt)
activate API
API     ->  Agent   : run(prompt)
activate Agent
Agent  -->  API     : résultat + trace
deactivate Agent
API     ->  IPFS    : upload(trace)
activate IPFS
IPFS   -->  API     : cidTrace
deactivate IPFS
API    -->  Client  : résultat

== Validation ==

API     ->  VR      : demandeValidation(idTâche, agentId, cidTrace)
activate VR
VR     -->  API     : ok
deactivate VR
API     ->  VR      : assignerJuges(idTâche, candidats)
activate VR
VR     ->  VR       : émet JugesAssignés(idsJuges)
activate VR
deactivate VR
VR     -->  API     : idsJuges
deactivate VR
API     ->  Judges  : évaluer(cidTrace)
activate Judges
Judges -->  API     : (vote, scores)
deactivate Judges
API     ->  VR      : commitVote(idTâche, idJuge, hash)
activate VR
VR     -->  API     : ok
deactivate VR
API     ->  VR      : revealVote(idTâche, idJuge, vote, scores)
activate VR
VR     -->  API     : ok
deactivate VR
API     ->  VR      : finaliserValidation(idTâche, justifURI)
activate VR
VR     ->  VR       : émet ScoreEnregistré(agentId, score)
activate VR
deactivate VR
VR     -->  API     : verdict + score
deactivate VR

API    -->  Client  : verdict + score
deactivate API
Client -->  Buyer   : verdict + score
deactivate Client

@enduml
